              "message": "Panels: remove the native dock's drawing, strip and drag code (#9583)\n\ncraft-ui's docking draws every layout, the default one included, so the\nnative dock's own renderer no longer runs. Remove dock::show with its\nper-frame group and strip records, peek, splitter resize, group and tab\ndrag and drop; the column height solver it used; DockLayout's move_group\nand move_tab, which only it called; panel_docking's drag promotion from\nthe native strip and its extra strip menu; the card widgets that drew the\nnative groups and the Pro tab strip; and the tab drag and reorder paths\nof the strip the Studio Properties card still uses.\n\nThe native dock's state, the commands that change it, the default layout\nbuilt from it and workspace loading and saving stay as they are. Tests\nof the removed code go; the default-height test runs on the drawn layout.",
